upgrade:
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "4.1.0"
    component:
      - trigger: cmsis_core
        description: >
          In CMSIS 5.8, the arm_math.h header has moved from CMSIS-Core to CMSIS-DSP. If arm_math.h isn't used in your project, you do not need to keep the CMSIS-DSP component.
        add:
          - cmsis_dsp
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2024.6.0"
    component:
      - trigger: silabs_core_sl_malloc
        description: >
          In simplicity_sdk 2024.6.0 the silabs_core_sl_malloc component was deprecated and replaced by memory_manager. Remove the silabs_core_sl_malloc component from your project.
        add:
          - memory_manager
        remove:
          - silabs_core_sl_malloc
      - trigger: peripheral_dcdc_coulomb_counter
        description: >
          In gecko_sdk 2024.6.0 the peripheral_dcdc_coulomb_counter component was renamed to hal_dcdc_coulomb_counter. Remove the peripheral_dcdc_coulomb_counter component from your project.
        add:
          - hal_dcdc_coulomb_counter
        remove:
          - peripheral_dcdc_coulomb_counter
      - trigger: peripheral_etampdet
        description: >
          In gecko_sdk 2024.6.0 the peripheral_etampdet component was renamed to hal_etampdet. Remove the peripheral_etampdet component from your project.
        add:
          - hal_etampdet
        remove:
          - peripheral_etampdet
      - trigger: peripheral_keyscan
        description: >
          In gecko_sdk 2024.6.0 the peripheral_keyscan component was renamed to hal_keyscan. Remove the peripheral_keyscan component from your project.
        add:
          - hal_keyscan
        remove:
          - peripheral_keyscan
      - trigger: peripheral_sysrtc
        description: >
          In gecko_sdk 2024.6.0 the peripheral_sysrtc component was renamed to hal_sysrtc. Remove the peripheral_sysrtc component from your project.
        add:
          - hal_sysrtc
        remove:
          - peripheral_sysrtc
    configuration:
      - script: platform_core/platform/scripts/upgrade_validation.lua
      - name: SL_EMLIB_CORE_ENABLE_INTERRUPT_DISABLED_TIMING
        replacement: SL_CORE_DEBUG_INTERRUPTS_MASKED_TIMING
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2025.6.0"
    component:
      - trigger: silabs_core_sl_malloc
        description: >
          In simplicity_sdk 2025.6.0 the silabs_core_sl_malloc component was removed and replaced by memory_manager. Remove the silabs_core_sl_malloc component from your project.
        add:
          - memory_manager
        remove:
          - silabs_core_sl_malloc
    configuration:
      - script: platform_core/platform/scripts/upgrade_iostream_eusart_fc.lua
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2026.6.0"
    component:
      - script: platform_core/platform/emdrv/component/upgrade_component_dmadrv.lua
        description: >
          When DMADRV was configured with round-robin channels (EMDRV_DMADRV_DMA_CH_PRIORITY < EMDRV_DMADRV_DMA_CH_COUNT),
          this upgrade adds the dma_manager_round_robin component so that round-robin scheduling is preserved.
      - script: platform_core/platform/scripts/upgrade_component_toolchain_lto.lua
        description: >
          Projects that still list toolchain_gcc_lto in the .slcp pull in toolchain_gcc by default, including
          when generating for IAR or LLVM, because that component requires the GCC toolchain. Use the
          toolchain_lto component instead; it selects toolchain_gcc_lto, toolchain_llvm_lto, or
          toolchain_iar_lto (no-op) from the project's toolchain. This upgrade removes toolchain_gcc_lto and
          adds toolchain_lto when present after upgrading to simplicity_sdk 2026.6.0.
    configuration:
      - script: platform_core/platform/emdrv/component/upgrade_configuration_dmadrv.lua
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2026.6.2"
    component:
      - trigger: SIBG301M104XIL_1MB
        description: >
          Starting from simplicity_sdk 2026.6.2 the SIBG301M104XIL_1MB component was replaced by SIBG301M104XIL with its associated external flash size (external_flash_1mb_s3).
        add:
          - SIBG301M104XIL
          - external_flash_1mb_s3
        remove:
          - SIBG301M104XIL_1MB
      - trigger: SIBG301M104XIL_2MB
        description: >
          Starting from simplicity_sdk 2026.6.2 the SIBG301M104XIL_2MB component was replaced by SIBG301M104XIL with its associated external flash size (external_flash_2mb_s3).
        add:
          - SIBG301M104XIL
          - external_flash_2mb_s3
        remove:
          - SIBG301M104XIL_2MB
      - trigger: SIBG301M104XIL_4MB
        description: >
          Starting from simplicity_sdk 2026.6.2 the SIBG301M104XIL_4MB component was replaced by SIBG301M104XIL with its associated external flash size (external_flash_4mb_s3).
        add:
          - SIBG301M104XIL
          - external_flash_4mb_s3
        remove:
          - SIBG301M104XIL_4MB
      - trigger: SIBG301M104XIL_8MB
        description: >
          Starting from simplicity_sdk 2026.6.2 the SIBG301M104XIL_8MB component was replaced by SIBG301M104XIL with its associated external flash size (external_flash_8mb_s3).
